# Static hosting rewrite fallback.
#
# This file is copied verbatim from static/ into public/_redirects by Zola.
# The current production path is Cloudflare Workers Builds, where
# worker/wrangler.toml routes /api/* through the Worker before static assets.
#
# The rule below is only for a legacy split deploy where the static site is
# hosted separately and the Worker lives on api.swimfrancisco.com. It rewrites
# same-origin /api/* calls to that Worker endpoint (status 200 = proxy rewrite).
#
# Uncomment once api.swimfrancisco.com is live:
# /api/*  https://api.swimfrancisco.com/api/:splat  200
